---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '../../assets/mwai-about.jpg';
import { u } from '../../lib/site';
---
<section class="wrap" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title" data-chaos>
  <div class="about">
    <figure class="polaroid">
      <div class="duotone"><Image src={portrait} alt="Moses Mwai standing outdoors in a dark polo shirt" widths={[320, 520]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 280px, 340px" /></div>
      <figcaption>me, before the coffee kicked in</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h2 id="about-title">It started with a Disney show about bionic teenagers.</h2>
      <p>Lab Rats got me hooked on the idea of building things that solve problems. I started out wanting to do hardware, but software won: you can go from an abstract problem to something real in an afternoon.</p>
      <p>I start with the problem, then look for the most efficient way to solve it, and I like proving the result with numbers. Outside code I read, binge shows and watch a lot of football, which is how a Fantasy Premier League model ended up on this bench.</p>
      <a class="btn" href={u('/about/')}>The longer story</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 340px) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: clamp(28px, 5vw, 72px); align-items: center; padding-block: clamp(24px, 4vw, 56px); }
  .polaroid { background: var(--paper-card); padding: 14px 14px 52px; transform: rotate(-3deg); box-shadow: 0 22px 34px -22px var(--shadow); position: relative; max-width: 340px; margin: 0; }
  .polaroid::before { content: ""; position: absolute; top: -12px; left: 34%; width: 110px; height: 26px; background: var(--tape); transform: rotate(4deg); z-index: 1; }
  .duotone { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; overflow: hidden; background: var(--r-pink); max-width: 100%; }
  .duotone :global(img) { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 18%; filter: grayscale(1) contrast(1.25) brightness(1.08); mix-blend-mode: multiply; display: block; }
  figcaption { position: absolute; bottom: 14px; left: 18px; right: 18px; font-family: var(--font-hand); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.05rem; }
  h2 { font-size: var(--step-3); line-height: 1.02; font-weight: 780; letter-spacing: -.02em; font-variation-settings: "opsz" 96, "wdth" 88; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 60ch; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: var(--step-1); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .about { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } .polaroid { max-width: 280px; } }
</style>
